      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2d30eb7f5743351142171b|full_name} I rely on opening the Steam menu to make me AFK as my headset doesn't have a sensor for when I take it off - it goes idle after several minutes of no motion, but when I'm in FBT I'm still contorting my avatar around - and (almost) anything I can do via the steam menu I can do better via XS Overlay.\n\nIt should go back the way it was, although as a bonus having a toggle to change that functionality could be nice.\n\nDefinitely been annoying as I currently don't have any way of immobilizing myself if I need to AFK.",
