  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThings like taking of your Headset or opening the SteamVR menu used to trigger the AFK animation if you had AFK detection enabled.\n\nThis no longer seems to work, I was unable to get AFL detection to work at all.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nYou should be put into AFK Mode if you have AFK detection enabled while them SteamVR Menu is open and if you are taking off your HMD, just like it does on live currently.",
